The derivative changes include static fills for the upstream CSS masks, an
offline skull body color adapted to the project's #ff6b6b danger token while
preserving the original #141414 face details, and 18x18 rasterization.
Changes are documented in README.md. This directory-level notice does not
change the license of the surrounding firmware project.
